        <profile id="35d1a7a4" name="Enhancement: Electro-static Flares (Aura) (Warlord)" typeId="a915f3e9" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">While a friendly T'au Empire unit (excluding Devilfish units) is within 6" of the bearer, enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to fire at that unit and each time a ranged attack targets that unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll. The bearer has a 4+ invulnerable save. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Prototype Systems: Each time the bearer is selected to shoot, you can re-roll one Hit roll and you can re-roll one Wound roll when resolving those attacks. Each time you roll to determine the number of attacks made with the bearer's airbursting fragmentation projector, you can re-roll the result. The bearer has a 4+ invulnerable save.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
